- https://programming-23.mooc.fi/ — Introductory programming course with modern practices
- https://cybersecuritybase.mooc.fi/ — Free cybersecurity course covering core security topics
- https://www.elementsofai.com/ — Introductory course explaining fundamentals of artificial intelligence
- https://news.ycombinator.com/ — Hacker News tech community (duplicate link)
- https://rust-lang.org/ — Official Rust programming language website and documentation
- https://cheats.rs/ — Rust language cheat sheet and quick reference
