- https://man7.org/tlpi/ — The Linux Programming Interface reference and resources
- https://rust-hosted-langs.github.io/book/introduction.html — Guide to building programming languages in Rust
- https://jeffe.cs.illinois.edu/teaching/algorithms/ — Advanced algorithms course notes by Jeff Erickson
- https://www.chrislaux.com/ — Technical notes and programming resources
- https://elementsofprogramming.com/ — Resource on generic programming and algorithm design
- https://solar.lowtechmagazine.com/ — Articles on sustainable technology and low-energy systems
- https://cs50.harvard.edu/sql/ — Harvard CS50 course on databases and SQL
- https://cs50.harvard.edu/web/ — Harvard CS50 course on web development
- https://teachyourselfcs.com/ — Self-taught CS curriculum (duplicate link)
